{"id":"memoria","lemma":"memoria","pos":"noun","rank":959,"glosses":["memory (the ability of the brain to record information)","memory (a specific thing that is remembered)","report, document"],"ipa":"/meˈmoɾja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"memorias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-memoria.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me lo sé de memoria.","en":"I know it by heart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450010","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Me gustaría tener mejor memoria.","en":"I wish I had a better memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553578","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"better"},null]},{"text":"Mi hermano tiene buena memoria.","en":"My brother has a good memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767771","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]},{"text":"Aún lo tengo fresco en mi memoria.","en":"It is still fresh in my memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703482","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"fresh"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Yo desearía tener una mejor memoria.","en":"I'd like to have a better memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65176","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"better"},null]}]}